    AG -->|Confidence score + explanation| UI
    AG -->|Preview plan| PR[Plan preview]
    UI -->|Apply plan| OWN[Owner / Pet data]
    OWN --> JSON[(pawpal_data.json)]
    UI -->|CLI demo| CLI[main.py]
    CLI --> AG
    CLI --> SCH
    UI -->|Tests and manual review| H[Human reviewer]
